Subject: [PATCH] [3.14] gh-158907: Do not send proxy credentials to a direct
 origin on 407 (GH-158956) (#161920)

gh-158907: Do not send proxy credentials to a direct origin on 407 (GH-158956)

ProxyBasicAuthHandler and ProxyDigestAuthHandler looked up passwords with the scheme-less origin host, so an HTTP 407 could match credentials stored for HTTPS and retry in cleartext.

---------
(cherry picked from commit ab48ba8edf267d11397255e5a28e37f2ed1caeac)

Co-authored-by: rajorin <167426833+rajorin@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-authored-by: Senthil Kumaran <senthil@python.org>
